esponse  through sunday many believe a precursor  to an eventual full-scale invasion to  unify taiwan with china by force if  needed  and the tension keeps rising in the past  few hours china announced it's now  placing sanctions on speaker pelosi as  well as her family but nate those are  pretty much symbolic  raminosencio in london thank you
 

